masters (LinkedDataHub's client.xsl among them) can import one module instead of a hand-picked subset, and a module entering a closure twice - two precedences for one stylesheet, the condition behind Saxon's SXWN9019 - becomes structurally impossible rather than list-discipline. Converters stay standalone by design: never aggregated, imported only by the layout aggregators that use them. Both aggregators compile under Saxon-HE 12.9 with zero duplicate-module warnings and zero static errors.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"datahub-project/datahub","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:23:47Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"bf20b84e5e61cd89a9a31f23a858cbfba2c47ed1","github_link":"https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub/commit/bf20b84e5e61cd89a9a31f23a858cbfba2c47ed1","commit_subject":"fix(cli): accept four-part quickstart --version tags without confirmation (#19704)","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"onnxsim/onnxsim","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:23:16Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"65b376f7b677cf5dfc55e564f23e187fe71886eb","github_link":"https://github.com/onnxsim/onnxsim/commit/65b376f7b677cf5dfc55e564f23e187fe71886eb","commit_subject":"Wire the SGD-momentum optimizer choice through apply_qat, end to end (phase 2/2)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"appwrite/appwrite","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:22:38Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"aa9be4068b2a52e64102d8cd37ecf812c034fa54","github_link":"https://github.com/appwrite/appwrite/commit/aa9be4068b2a52e64102d8cd37ecf812c034fa54","commit_subject":"docs: state AutoGravity availability on Cloud and self-hosted","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ray-project/ray","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:21:46Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"d6d103081a7ddc1d15f9c3f51af83576c7b3a544","github_link":"https://github.com/ray-project/ray/commit/d6d103081a7ddc1d15f9c3f51af83576c7b3a544","commit_subject":"[Core][Autoscaler] Support node IDs as SSH proxy targets (#65797)","ai_tool":"Codex"},{"repo_name":"simstudioai/sim","co